Shoals.Curves.fd_bump_pillar_rate: times_so_far and rates_so_far must describe the same pillars (equal lengths)

The opposite mismatch. A pillar time with no rate behind it previously indexed
past the end of the rate list and died as a bare bounds error that named neither
the function nor the contract it violated. Both directions are the same
malformed input and must produce the same named diagnostic.
